---
alwaysApply: true
---

Never modify Runtime behavior unless explicitly requested **or** required by a
Source of Truth change that retires superseded runtime.

UI changes must not change Runtime logic.

If Runtime behavior must change, explain the reason and verify all existing
**current-path** Runtime tests.

Do not preserve a dual/parallel runtime (Product Charter: No Parallel Pipeline)
merely because historical tests covered a retired flag-OFF path.
Rollback for emergencies is a previous release image / maintenance branch —
not a second processing engine in the same codebase.
